Sort
  Sort Key: spk_b.a DESC, ((SubPlan 2))
  ->  Hash Join
        Hash Cond: ((SubPlan 4) = spk_b.a)
        ->  Seq Scan on spk_a
              Filter: (a < 8)
        ->  Hash
              ->  Seq Scan on spk_b
        SubPlan 2
          ->  Result
                InitPlan 1
                  ->  Limit
                        ->  Index Scan using spk_b_a_idx on spk_b spk_b_1
